# OpenAI — enables POST /api/visualize (POST /api/plans works without it)
# Allowed models: gpt-4o-mini, gpt-4o-2024-08-06, gpt-4.1-nano, gpt-4.1-mini, gpt-4.1,
#   gpt-5-mini, gpt-5, gpt-5.1, gpt-5.2, gpt-5.4-nano, gpt-5.4-mini, gpt-5.4
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional: planner model (default gpt-5.4-mini) and reasoning effort (default low; leave
# empty for models without reasoning, e.g. gpt-4.1-mini)
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini
# OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT=low
